*1 [[Mass Production EVA (Enemy)|Mass Production EVA]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Mass Production EVA (Enemy)|Mass Production EVAs]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Mass Production EVA (Enemy)|Mass Production EVAs]] spawn after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
