*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The boss and peons doesn't push very hard so they can be stalled without much. A ranged Critter can be used to deal with the occassional Metal Doge while a long range attacker minimum will suffice for Mass Production EVAs. Units like [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] can be used to take advantage of Mass Production EVA's long TBA to deal chip damage.

